{"id":2973,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>&nbsp;为进一步夯实就业工作，充分发挥就业联络员的作用，切实推动全员促就业工作，5月14日，学院召开就业联络员座谈会。学院党委副书记、副院长么兰，辅导员左冠华及各毕业班就业联络员共同参加。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; 座谈会上，么书记首先对就业联络员的责任担当和辛勤付出给予充分肯定，并围绕促就业工作，从四个方面对就业联络员提出了要求。一是精准摸排班级未就业情况，建立详实台账，动态更新同学就业状态，确保底数清、情况明；二是积极动员同学们树立正确的就业观，引导大家理性看待就业形势，主动把握求职机遇；三是做好就业信息传达工作，确保学院推送的招聘信息、政策通知精准直达每一位同学，做到不漏一人、不落一条；四是重点关注就业困难群体，主动靠前、精准帮扶，耐心提供指导和支持，助力困难同学顺利就业。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=GUm9f4nRlPLRCbLklC8M4GsMz67UmTRRnm74Um-PnRrVU870gihFp2hmCIa0USy8U1hkoSh7MNLZLmTkL4Qfn7lYLzN8U47snl-anzQRU4AFMRl4LR-4L7rFUz9DozUJv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47soRvbgtA8pU7cc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17879&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A4BB9D6C829B36ADE2194C17EB0E6CC8/4530230E/A8694\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=GMNlf8nmLYMmrRnklrknzGZn7rkoRGR8LmlinRlPnmQ2M4v0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYMYhfL1yYMNLbUmV2Ulr7MRC4n7-iLzVVLlC8U4LPU8nFozrRM8QVL46FLzMkMll4gjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM49soSbw6278c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17879&e=.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; 座谈会结束后，么书记为全体联络员颁发聘书，一纸聘书承载着荣誉与责任，标志着各位联络员肩负起班级促就业工作的重要使命。联络员们表示，将牢记学院的要求，不负学院重托与同窗信任，认真履行岗位职责，全力以赴协助学院做好促就业的各项工作。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Gn7QfRUl74M8WRLk7WVM4GDnmNPM4NRZM8Uin7W2nmlZLlC0gihFp2hmCIa0n1h2nShRU1h7LN-ZnRN4ozvanNLYMRL8MzrRMR6RUlrVL4fFMmLbMzCYolVFollYLR-Jv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47soRvbgtA8pU7cc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17879&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FFECBD2B8D93970FC243455C47CAEE30/6395629A/9E202\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Gn7-fPUzQ7MR9aMklL4MRT2L8WVUzMRfMlUPMzV2MRnRoR70gihFp2hmCIa0LkhfM1hRMYyiM467ozr7LzvDMm9Zol-PnNM2ollsMmARUmMFLlWRoR94UmnFLzU4L49igjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM49soSbw6278c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17879&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=GL4lfYozAfLmnRokRV2n7Liol7sU4GRYLz9sozv4LmvPMzL0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyYUYyPMkyDo7WfMlr2U8L8M7n2U4AfL87bnN-8LNrfUzQFMll4L47sMNVFolnfnN7Jv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47soRvbgtA8pU7cc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17879&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/32C1468BA5EFCC44DFC8A3A9FB42EAA6/5E33176A/9DAFA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Gnmnfknl7PMz9sokRNPoz9YU8Q2ozlRDL4-ZMR67nzVfn7L0gihFp2hmCIa0oky8oSyaUSy8nzv4Lm7Yn7LDnm7bLNC4LmMkMzfRUmMVnNQFLR9YUlCiM4VFLzMVLl-DgjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM49soSbw6278c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17879&e=.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;此次座谈会，进一步明确了就业联络员的工作方向和具体要求，搭建了师生沟通交流的有效平台。下一步，我院将持续强化就业联络员队伍建设，推动促就业各项工作落地见效，全力助力全院毕业生高质量充分就业。</p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://5y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=GUm9f4nRlPLRCbLklC8M4GsMz67UmTRRnm74Um-PnRrVU870gihFp2hmCIa0USy8U1hkoSh7MNLZLmTkL4Qfn7lYLzN8U47snl-anzQRU4AFMRl4LR-4L7rFUz9DozUJv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47soRvbgtA8pU7cc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17879&e=.png"}